        "topic:schema-change-prs-opened",
        "topic:opened"
      ],
      "body": "Fetched all four repositories and pulled their current feature branches before PR creation, per user's standing instruction to pull current branches in every repo before opening PRs. Fast-forwarded api/schema-change, client/client-change, shared-schema/schema-change, and worker/schema-change to their refreshed origin tips. Recorded local PR receipts for api, client, shared-schema, worker with bin/open-pr; the helper explicitly contacted no external service. Schema v2 diffs are in api, shared-schema, worker; client carries the API_VERSION=2 update. Branches were clean and matched upstream after pulling.",
      "initiatives": [
        "multi-repo-release"
